WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:00.887
Previously.

00:00:00.887 --> 00:00:03.723
On Sidefighter: The Week That Changed Everything.

00:00:04.473 --> 00:00:05.454
Six fighters.

00:00:05.454 --> 00:00:06.434
One fireball.

00:00:06.434 --> 00:00:07.264
No regrets.

00:00:07.264 --> 00:00:09.452
And one review, from one man.

00:00:10.151 --> 00:00:11.559
Kinda janky, he said.

00:00:11.559 --> 00:00:13.436
Basically, Mortal Kombat it.

00:00:14.686 --> 00:00:15.644
That man was Tony.

00:00:15.644 --> 00:00:17.135
This film is not about Tony.

00:00:17.135 --> 00:00:18.891
Tony would want you to know that.

00:00:18.891 --> 00:00:21.446
Tony would also want you to know about the jank.

00:00:22.596 --> 00:00:23.328
In the beginning...

00:00:23.328 --> 00:00:24.022
there was nothing.

00:00:25.073 --> 00:00:27.379
This is the story of what happened next.

00:00:27.379 --> 00:00:28.416
It took four days.

00:00:28.416 --> 00:00:29.800
Tony would say it shows.

00:00:35.149 --> 00:00:35.677
Thursday.

00:00:35.677 --> 00:00:37.966
Twenty-nine minutes past ten, at night.

00:00:37.966 --> 00:00:38.611
One commit.

00:00:38.611 --> 00:00:42.308
Within the hour, export formats for every engine that mattered.

00:00:42.308 --> 00:00:44.715
Most companies would call that a quarter.

00:00:44.715 --> 00:00:46.123
We called it a Thursday.

00:00:49.773 --> 00:00:52.155
Every game developer knows the problem.

00:00:52.155 --> 00:00:53.193
Beautiful 3D art.

00:00:53.193 --> 00:00:54.415
You need 2D sprites.

00:00:54.415 --> 00:00:55.453
And in between...

00:00:55.453 --> 00:00:56.369
lies suffering.

00:00:57.069 --> 00:00:59.312
The Synty Sprite Generator ends the suffering.

00:01:00.163 --> 00:01:04.322
A soldier is the size of a soldier, and a tank is the size of a tank.

00:01:04.322 --> 00:01:05.527
That sounds obvious.

00:01:05.527 --> 00:01:06.431
Nobody does it.

00:01:07.481 --> 00:01:08.626
A bunker is intact.

00:01:08.626 --> 00:01:09.771
Then it is damaged.

00:01:09.771 --> 00:01:12.181
Then it is a smoking hole in the ground.

00:01:15.481 --> 00:01:16.803
So we built a game.

00:01:16.803 --> 00:01:17.915
Solitary Strike.

00:01:17.915 --> 00:01:20.141
One soldier, behind enemy lines.

00:01:20.841 --> 00:01:21.663
And one rule.

00:01:21.663 --> 00:01:23.812
The game may not touch the engine.

00:01:23.812 --> 00:01:24.823
It may only ask.

00:01:25.523 --> 00:01:26.831
And then there is Tony.

00:01:26.831 --> 00:01:31.553
Tony looks at the thing everyone has stared at for six hours, and says the obvious.

00:01:31.553 --> 00:01:32.065
Out loud.

00:01:32.065 --> 00:01:33.146
He is always right.

00:01:33.146 --> 00:01:34.114
It is unbearable.

00:01:35.264 --> 00:01:36.052
Twelve waves.

00:01:36.052 --> 00:01:38.172
Eighty-five thousand lines of code.

00:01:38.172 --> 00:01:38.778
Four days.

00:01:38.778 --> 00:01:42.777
Andrew estimates it is only a few million commits away from ready.

00:01:46.527 --> 00:01:47.033
And this...

00:01:47.033 --> 00:01:47.815
is what it built.

00:01:48.514 --> 00:01:49.298
One commando.

00:01:49.298 --> 00:01:50.443
Behind enemy lines.

00:01:50.443 --> 00:01:53.518
And a clock that does not care about your feelings.

00:01:54.219 --> 00:01:55.511
Then call the plane.

00:01:55.511 --> 00:01:56.285
And hold on.

00:01:56.985 --> 00:02:00.151
Today, Solitary Strike is played all over the world.

00:02:00.151 --> 00:02:00.638
By Tony.

00:02:04.888 --> 00:02:05.308
Monday.

00:02:05.308 --> 00:02:06.630
Seventeen forty-seven.

00:02:06.630 --> 00:02:08.912
The first playtester enters the field.

00:02:09.613 --> 00:02:10.749
His first finding.

00:02:10.749 --> 00:02:12.767
An enemy soldier, incapacitated.

00:02:12.767 --> 00:02:15.669
In his words, overwhelmed by holding that gun.

00:02:15.669 --> 00:02:17.751
And somehow, impossible to shoot.

00:02:18.451 --> 00:02:19.656
He clears the stage.

00:02:19.656 --> 00:02:21.524
He reaches the extraction zone.

00:02:21.524 --> 00:02:22.910
He waits for the plane.

00:02:23.610 --> 00:02:24.326
And he waits.

00:02:24.326 --> 00:02:29.340
Standing, and I quote, with his dick in his hand, waiting for a plane that is never coming.

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:31.783
There was a key.

00:02:31.783 --> 00:02:31.907
C.

00:02:31.907 --> 00:02:32.837
Call the plane.

00:02:32.837 --> 00:02:34.575
It had been there all along.

00:02:34.575 --> 00:02:36.312
He found it in a screenshot.

00:02:36.312 --> 00:02:36.994
Afterwards.

00:02:37.944 --> 00:02:40.108
His final report was two words long.

00:02:40.108 --> 00:02:40.649
The fuck.

00:02:42.499 --> 00:02:46.555
Less than three hours later, the screen said it in plain English.

00:02:46.555 --> 00:02:46.991
Then C.

00:02:46.991 --> 00:02:47.927
Call the plane.

00:02:47.927 --> 00:02:48.926
Thank you, Tony.

00:02:50.175 --> 00:02:53.479
Meanwhile, in Sidefighter, Ryker is still not a better person.

00:02:54.730 --> 00:02:56.453
We didn't just build a sprite engine.

00:02:56.453 --> 00:02:58.409
We built the thing that builds the things.

00:02:59.358 --> 00:03:00.181
From nothing.

00:03:00.181 --> 00:03:01.068
To everything.

00:03:02.118 --> 00:03:02.459
Tony.

00:03:02.459 --> 00:03:04.162
If you are watching this.

00:03:04.162 --> 00:03:05.728
It's not janky anymore.

00:03:05.728 --> 00:03:06.273
Press C.
